+4.  **Determine Surface Orientation (Per Block):**
+    For each block at grid position $(x, y, z)$ within the chunk:
+    *   Calculate world coordinates:
+        $$ X = ChunkX + x \cdot B $$
+        $$ Y = ChunkY + y \cdot B $$
+        $$ Z_{bottom} = ChunkZ + z \cdot B $$
+        $$ Z_{top} = Z_{bottom} + B $$
